# Terminal Execution Policy
- AUTO-RUN (No permission needed): cd, ls, cat, grep, git show, git diff, git status, pwd, find, ./yb_build.sh, tee, tail or any read-only command, any read-only git subcommand
- ALWAYS ASK: rm, git commit, git push, git reset, bazel build, any script execution (./*.sh).
- DO NOT RUN: sudo, chmod, or any destructive disk utility.
